{%- layout none -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Alternate page template "llms" -> assign to a page to serve a GEO llms.txt-style
  manifest at /pages/<handle> (also reachable via the /llms.txt redirect).
  Lists brand, collections and key pages so answer engines can ground
  answers about the store.

  Keep this file free of multi-line {% # %} inline comments: every line of one
  must start with "#", otherwise the file is a Liquid syntax error and
  Shopify's GitHub sync silently skips it (which is how this template went
  missing from the live theme twice).
{%- endcomment -%}
# {{ shop.name }}

> {{ shop.description | default: settings.seo_brand_description | default: page.content | strip_html | truncatewords: 40 }}

This is the official storefront of {{ shop.name }} ({{ request.origin }}).

## Collections
{% for collection in collections -%}
{%- unless collection.handle == 'frontpage' or collection.products_count == 0 -%}
- [{{ collection.title }}]({{ request.origin }}{{ collection.url }}): {{ collection.description | strip_html | truncatewords: 25 | default: collection.title }}
{% endunless -%}
{%- endfor %}

## Pages
{% for p in pages -%}
{%- unless p.handle == page.handle -%}
- [{{ p.title }}]({{ request.origin }}{{ p.url }})
{% endunless -%}
{%- endfor %}

## Policies & Contact
- Search: {{ request.origin }}{{ routes.search_url }}
- All products: {{ request.origin }}{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}
- Sitemap: {{ request.origin }}/sitemap.xml

_Last generated from live store data on request. Brand: {{ shop.name }}._
